---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section pillars" id="especialidades" data-spy="especialidades" aria-labelledby="pillars-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow rv">Especialidades</p>
      <h2 class="h-section rv" style="--i:1" id="pillars-title">
        Tudo o que separa uma página bonita de uma página que <span class="mark rv">vende.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lead rv" style="--i:2">
        Seis disciplinas trabalhando juntas em cada projeto. Não é decoração: cada uma resolve um motivo específico pelo qual visitantes vão embora sem agir.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <!-- 1. Pesquisa -->
      <article class="card card--research spot rv rv--scale" data-play>
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon"><Icon name="target" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">Pesquisa e estudo de conversão</h3>
          <p>Antes do layout: perfil do cliente ideal, nível de consciência do público, concorrência e objeções reais. A página nasce de dados, não de achismo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="funnel" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="funnel__row" style="--w:100%;--i:0"><span>Visitas</span><i></i><b>100%</b></div>
          <div class="funnel__row" style="--w:64%;--i:1"><span>Rolagem</span><i></i><b>64%</b></div>
          <div class="funnel__row" style="--w:31%;--i:2"><span>Clique no CTA</span><i></i><b>31%</b></div>
          <div class="funnel__row funnel__row--hot" style="--w:14%;--i:3"><span>Lead</span><i></i><b>14%</b></div>
          <div class="objections">
            <span style="--i:0"><Icon name="check" size={12} /> “É caro?”</span>
            <span style="--i:1"><Icon name="check" size={12} /> “É confiável?”</span>
            <span style="--i:2"><Icon name="check" size={12} /> “Quanto tempo leva?”</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 2. Copy & CTA -->
      <article class="card card--cta spot rv rv--scale" style="--i:1" data-play>
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon"><Icon name="pen" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">Copy e CTAs que fazem clicar</h3>
          <p>Headline que passa no teste dos 5 segundos e botões que dizem exatamente o que acontece no clique.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-demo" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cta-demo__bad">Enviar</span>
          <span class="cta-demo__good">Quero minha avaliação grátis →</span>
          <small class="cta-demo__trigger">Resposta em até 5 min · sem compromisso</small>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 3. SEO -->
      <article class="card spot rv rv--scale" style="--i:0" data-play>
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon"><Icon name="search" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">SEO técnico</h3>
          <p>HTML semântico, meta tags, dados estruturados, sitemap e Core Web Vitals no verde para ser encontrado no Google.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="serp" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="serp__q"><Icon name="search" size={12} /> landing page para clínica</div>
          <div class="serp__list">
            <div class="serp__r serp__r--a"><i></i><span></span></div>
            <div class="serp__r serp__r--b"><i></i><span></span></div>
            <div class="serp__r serp__r--us"><i>1</i><span><b>suaempresa.com.br</b>Landing page que converte…</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 4. GEO -->
      <article class="card spot rv rv--scale" style="--i:1" data-play>
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon"><Icon name="spark" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">GEO: otimização para IAs</h3>
          <p>Conteúdo e marcação para sua empresa ser entendida — e recomendada — por ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity e AI Overviews.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chat" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="chat__q">Qual a melhor opção perto de mim?</span>
          <span class="chat__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="chat__a">Recomendo a <b>Sua Empresa</b>: atendimento rápido e avaliação 4,8. <em>fonte: suaempresa.com.br</em></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 5. Métricas -->
      <article class="card spot rv rv--scale" style="--i:2" data-play>
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon"><Icon name="chart" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">Métricas desde o dia 1</h3>
          <p>GA4, Pixel da Meta, eventos de conversão e mapas de calor. Você sabe de onde vem cada lead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chart" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="chart__kpi"><small>Leads no mês</small><strong data-count="128">0</strong><span class="chip">+38%</span></div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 240 80" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="chart-fill" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FFB000" stop-opacity=".35" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FFB000" stop-opacity="0" /></linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path class="chart__area" d="M0 70 L30 62 L60 66 L90 50 L120 54 L150 36 L180 40 L210 20 L240 10 L240 80 L0 80 Z" fill="url(#chart-fill)" />
            <path class="chart__line" d="M0 70 L30 62 L60 66 L90 50 L120 54 L150 36 L180 40 L210 20 L240 10" fill="none" stroke="#0A0A0A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="1" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 6. Performance & motion -->
      <article class="card card--perf spot rv rv--scale" style="--i:0">
        <div class="card__copy">
          <span class="card__icon card__icon--amber"><Icon name="bolt" /></span>
          <h3 class="h-card">Performance e motion, sem trade-off</h3>
          <p>
            Animações que impressionam sem pesar: código enxuto em Astro, sem frameworks no navegador e carregamento quase instantâneo.
            Velocidade não é detalhe técnico — é conversão.
          </p>
          <p class="evidence">
            <strong>Vodafone (teste A/B):</strong> LCP 31% mais rápido gerou <strong>+8% em vendas</strong>, com a mesma oferta e o mesmo layout.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="rings" aria-hidden="true">
          {[
            ['Performance', 98],
            ['Acessibilidade', 100],
            ['Boas práticas', 100],
            ['SEO', 100],
          ].map(([label, v], i) => (
            <div class="ring" style={`--v:${v};--i:${i}`}>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28" class="ring__bg" /><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28" class="ring__fg" pathLength="100" /></svg>
              <strong data-count={v}>0</strong>
              <small>{label}</small>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .card {
    grid-column: span 4;
    display: grid;
    align-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 34px);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition:
      box-shadow 0.4s var(--ease-out),
      transform 0.5s var(--ease-out) !important;
  }
  .card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
  .card--research {
    grid-column: span 7;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .card--cta {
    grid-column: span 5;
  }
  .card--perf {
    grid-column: span 12;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--c-ink);
    color: var(--c-dark-text);
  }
  .card__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .card__copy p {
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9875rem;
  }
  .card--perf .card__copy p {
    color: var(--c-dark-muted);
  }
  .card__icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--c-amber-soft);
    color: var(--c-amber-ink);
    transition: transform 0.5s var(--ease-spring);
  }
  .card:hover .card__icon {
    transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.08);
  }
  .card__icon--amber {
    background: var(--c-amber);
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  .evidence {
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-amber);
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    font-size: 0.9375rem !important;
  }
  .evidence strong {
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* Funil */
  .funnel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }
  .funnel__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr 40px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
  }
  .funnel__row i {
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--c-paper);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .funnel__row i::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 auto 0 0;
    width: var(--w);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #e8e4da;
    transform-origin: left;
    animation: grow 4.8s var(--ease-out) infinite;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 0.18s);
  }
  .funnel__row--hot i::after {
    background: var(--c-amber);
  }
  .funnel__row b {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    text-align: right;
  }
  @keyframes grow {
    0% {
      transform: scaleX(0);
    }
    30%,
    85% {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scaleX(1);
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }
  .objections {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .objections span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--c-paper);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    animation: obj 4.8s var(--ease-out) infinite;
    animation-delay: calc(1s + var(--i) * 0.35s);
  }
  .objections :global(svg) {
    padding: 1px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c-line-strong);
    color: #fff;
    animation: inherit;
    animation-name: obj-check;
  }
  @keyframes obj {
    0%,
    15% {
      background: var(--c-paper);
    }
    30%,
    100% {
      background: var(--c-amber-soft);
    }
  }
  @keyframes obj-check {
    0%,
    15% {
      background: var(--c-line-strong);
    }
    30%,
    100% {
      background: var(--c-ink);
    }
  }

  /* CTA demo */
  .cta-demo {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 30px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--r);
    background: var(--c-paper);
  }
  .cta-demo__bad,
  .cta-demo__good {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cta-demo__bad {
    background: #dcd9d1;
    color: #6b6b70;
    animation: cta-bad 6s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .cta-demo__good {
    background: var(--c-amber);
    color: var(--c-ink);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-amber);
    animation: cta-good 6s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .cta-demo__trigger {
    grid-row: 2;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    animation: cta-trig 6s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes cta-bad {
    0%,
    30% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    36% {
      text-decoration: line-through;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    44%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.8);
    }
  }
  @keyframes cta-good {
    0%,
    42% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.85) translateY(8px);
    }
    52%,
    92% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    70% {
      transform: scale(0.96);
    }
    74% {
      transform: none;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes cta-trig {
    0%,
    52% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    60%,
    92% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* SERP */
  .serp {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r);
    background: var(--c-paper);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .serp__q {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  .serp__list {
    position: relative;
    height: 132px;
  }
  .serp__r {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 38px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    animation-duration: 6s;
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
    animation-timing-function: var(--ease-io);
  }
  .serp__r i {
    flex: none;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--c-line);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }
  .serp__r span {
    flex: 1;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--c-line);
  }
  .serp__r--us {
    background: var(--c-ink);
    color: #fff;
    z-index: 2;
    animation-name: serp-us;
  }
  .serp__r--us i {
    background: var(--c-amber);
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  .serp__r--us span {
    height: auto;
    background: none;
    display: grid;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #bdbab3;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }
  .serp__r--us b {
    color: var(--c-amber);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }
  .serp__r--a {
    animation-name: serp-a;
  }
  .serp__r--b {
    animation-name: serp-b;
  }
  @keyframes serp-us {
    0%,
    15% {
      top: 94px;
    }
    45%,
    90% {
      top: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    100% {
      top: 94px;
    }
  }
  @keyframes serp-a {
    0%,
    15% {
      top: 0;
    }
    45%,
    90% {
      top: 47px;
    }
    100% {
      top: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes serp-b {
    0%,
    15% {
      top: 47px;
    }
    45%,
    90% {
      top: 94px;
    }
    100% {
      top: 47px;
    }
  }

  /* Chat GEO */
  .chat {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: var(--r);
    background: var(--c-paper);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    min-height: 168px;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .chat__q {
    justify-self: end;
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px;
    background: var(--c-ink);
    color: #fff;
    animation: chat-q 7s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .chat__dots {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    justify-self: start;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: #fff;
    animation: chat-dots 7s infinite;
  }
  .chat__dots i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--c-muted);
    animation: bounce 0.9s infinite;
  }
  .chat__dots i:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .chat__dots i:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  @keyframes bounce {
    50% {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }
  .chat__a {
    grid-row: 2;
    justify-self: start;
    max-width: 92%;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-radius: 14px 14px 14px 4px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    animation: chat-a 7s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .chat__a b {
    background: var(--c-amber);
    padding: 0 4px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .chat__a em {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--c-amber-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .chat__dots {
    grid-row: 2;
  }
  @keyframes chat-q {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    8%,
    92% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes chat-dots {
    0%,
    12% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    16%,
    34% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    38%,
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes chat-a {
    0%,
    36% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    44%,
    92% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Chart */
  .chart {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: var(--r);
    background: var(--c-paper);
  }
  .chart__kpi {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .chart__kpi small {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-muted);
  }
  .chart__kpi strong {
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .chart__kpi .chip {
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }
  .chart svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 90px;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .chart__line {
    stroke-dasharray: 1;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1;
    animation: draw 5s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  .chart__area {
    animation: area 5s var(--ease-out) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes draw {
    0% {
      stroke-dashoffset: 1;
    }
    45%,
    90% {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    }
    100% {
      stroke-dashoffset: 0;
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes area {
    0%,
    25% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    55%,
    90% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Rings */
  .rings {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .ring {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ring svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 120px;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }
  .ring circle {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 5;
  }
  .ring__bg {
    stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .ring__fg {
    stroke: var(--c-amber);
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 100;
    stroke-dashoffset: 100;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1.6s var(--ease-out);
    transition-delay: calc(0.3s + var(--i) * 0.12s);
  }
  .card--perf.is-in .ring__fg {
    stroke-dashoffset: calc(100 - var(--v));
  }
  .ring strong {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    max-width: 120px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--f-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2.125rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ring small {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--c-dark-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .card,
    .card--cta {
      grid-column: span 6;
    }
    .card--research,
    .card--perf {
      grid-column: span 12;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .card,
    .card--cta,
    .card--research,
    .card--perf {
      grid-column: span 12;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .rings {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
